19T11:09:52Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T20:25:00Z","closed_at":"2025-04-22T15:46:12Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105563","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105563","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105563.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105563.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-22T15:46:12Z"},"body":"Optimizes GridMap rendering scenario quadruple-getters.\r\n\r\nWhile trying to fix https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105562 I noticed that GridMap had a really wasteful way of getting the rendering scenario in a few places (or navigation map).\r\n\r\nThat quadruple getter for the rendering scenario can only be called once per function and outside the loops, instead of x-times. Especially the cell loop could call this a few thousand times for no reason. Also makes the code lines shorter and more readable.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/R